Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Demeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A spatial design studio that turns orchard planning into a landscape you can\Nexplore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,On a hillside, water, sunlight, structures and operating costs are\Nconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Demeter brings those decisions into one computed, three dimensional orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Start with a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A one hundred sixty by ninety metre orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve metres of elevation change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Two greenhouses, winter sunlight, and a four metre drone swath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Structured instructions update the design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The same scene data drives geometry and engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrain is reconstructed along terrace boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred eighty eight trees grow into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Foundations, columns and roof panels assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the water network extends from the source through the orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Each structure has a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Every parameter has a consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Greenhouse placement follows the available terraces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The design checks the building footprint, ground variation and separation\Nfrom obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Two protective structures become part of the orchard, with their own light\Ntransmission and construction costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Move through the solar day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrain ray tests estimate direct sunlight at each tree, while roof\Ntransmission changes the protected growing conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Compare locations before committing to a layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The hydraulic engine evaluates one hundred eight configurations of routes,\Npipe sizes, pumps and watering zones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty eight satisfy this scenario's constraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Compare cost, pressure and operating time, then inspect a balanced design in\Nthree dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Drone sweeps stay within the working area.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Transfer paths route around structures, with spraying switched off between\Nworking segments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan achieves ninety seven point three percent geometric coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring investment and annual operations into the same decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjust price and yield, compare cash flow and five year net present value,\Nand export the design with its inputs and calculation results.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The planner proposes structured edits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Validation preserves engineering constraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.61,0:02:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The solver supplies the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The model adapter uses this same contract, so the visual experience and the\Ncalculation pipeline stay connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Demeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,From a hillside to an orchard you can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Explore the source, run the project, and build your next design.
